<h2 class="wp-block-wd-title title wd-4b4d41a0">Delivery options overview</h2>
<!-- /wp:wd/title -->

<!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"b31e6c57-4fb2-4feb-9f0c-6f6837029a6a","blockVersion":"2"} -->
<p class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-b31e6c57">WoodMart offers ideal shipping methods for any requirement. Be it low priced through DHL/Standard Parcel Post, more quickly via DHL Express (Germany only) or UPS, or especially reliable and secure by a specifically trained freight forwarder. And in addition you can also pick up your order yourself at our Shop if you prefer. On this page you´ll find an overview of all available shipping methods.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph -->

